18
00:02:00,912 --> 00:02:09,024
[Slow] 昨日、近畿、中国、九州北部で梅雨明けしました。

19
00:02:09,824 --> 00:02:16,159
[Host] Yesterday, the rainy season ended in the Kinki, Chugoku, and northern Kyushu regions.

20
00:02:16,759 --> 00:02:19,256
