[Host] It means a normal or average year.

30
00:02:57,120 --> 00:03:04,584
[Slow] 特に佐賀県では、平年の2倍以上の雨が降りました。

31
00:03:05,383 --> 00:03:10,687
[Host] Especially in Saga Prefecture, more than twice the usual amount of rain fell.

32
00:03:11,288 --> 00:03:13,231
