33
00:03:13,632 --> 00:03:17,735
[Host] It means times, as in two times or double an amount.

34
00:03:18,336 --> 00:03:23,903
[Slow] これから、本格的な夏が始まります。

35
00:03:24,704 --> 00:03:28,352
[Host] From now on, summer in earnest begins.

36
