[Host] It means full-scale or in earnest, the real thing.

38
00:03:36,695 --> 00:03:42,575
[Slow] 9日は、さらに気温が上がる予想です。

39
00:03:43,376 --> 00:03:47,503
[Host] On the ninth, the temperature is forecast to rise even more.

40
00:03:48,104 --> 00:03:50,144
